  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p ><strong>What it is: </strong>A lip liner that enhances the natural shape of your lips with a smooth formula that blends effortlessly for a sculpted, defined look that lasts.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Liner</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating, Long-wearing, Plumping</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Carnauba and Candelilla Wax Blend: For rich, long-lasting color that resists feathering and is waterproof.</p><p>- Hyaluronic Filling Spheres: For a tug-free glide, leaving lips smooth, nourished and fuller-looking.</p><p>- Coconut and Jojoba Oil Blend: For lightweight nourishment, helping to soften lips and lock in moisture.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p ><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-Apply to clean, dry lips.</p><p>-Contour, line or fill in as desired.</p><p>-Pair with your favorite lip product.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >-Carnauba and Candelilla Wax Blend: For rich, long-lasting color that resists feathering and is waterproof.</p><p>-Hyaluronic Filling Spheres: For a tug-free glide, leaving lips smooth, nourished, and fuller-looking.</p><p>-Coconut and Jojoba Oil Blend: For lightweight nourishment, helping to soften lips and lock in moisture.</p><p><br></p><p>Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, C10-18 Triglycerides, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax/Cera Carnauba/Cire De Carnauba, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax/Candelilla Cera/Cire De Candelilla, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Mica, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Panthenol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Tocopherol, Trihydroxystearin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-) Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Red 7 Lake (Ci 15850), Red 6 (Ci 15850).</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;<em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
